  "title": "I Begged My Husband to Save Our Baby—He Sent $100 and Took His Mistress to a Gala!#drama #ai",
  "description": "Introduction：The protagonist is on the verge of marrying military officer Adrian Hayes when, on the eve of the wedding, her mother falls critically ill, requiring a $50,000 deposit for emergency surgery.<br><br>Desperate, she turns to her fiancé for help. Although Adrian pays the sum, he comes to view her as nothing more than a woman who only cares about money.<br><br>After they marry, he becomes chillingly indifferent:<br>When she is involved in a car accident, he simply transfers $100.<br>When her mother passes away, she begs him to attend the funeral; he responds only by transferring another $100.<br>Upon discovering she is pregnant, she sends him 77 voice messages—he doesn’t listen to a single one, choosing instead to send 77 separate transfers of $100 each.<br>During her pregnancy, she suffers a hemorrhage and is rushed to the hospital for emergency care. She calls him, weeping and pleading for him to come and save their child—but all she receives is another $100.<br>Meanwhile, Adrian—dressed in his formal military uniform—is escorting another woman, Madeline, to an opulent military charity gala.<br><br>Madeline even posts a photo of them together on Instagram, leading everyone to believe they are the perfect match.<br><br>It is only when Adrian finally checks his phone that his adjutant, trembling, delivers the news:<br><br>&quot;Major Hayes... your wife and child did not survive.&quot;<br><br>In that instant, the man who had remained so cold and heartless completely shatters.<br><br>He finally realizes that he, with his own hands, has destroyed the people who mattered most.<br><br>🔥 Welcome to our Revenge Drama Recap Channel!<br><br><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCTx_ffhpRnftD4OIM2DqnFg\">@sweetrevengedrama-n9c</a><br><br>Get ready for the ultimate revenge stories!<br><br>We bring you thrilling movie recaps filled with betrayal, heartbreak, shocking twists, and satisfying revenge. From the innocent who were betrayed to the powerf